{"id":"648403","name":"辣酱拌蔬菜","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648403/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"豆芽儿","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"韭菜叶","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜去掉皮。","img":"images/648403/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成丝。","img":"images/648403/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆芽儿放入锅中煮。","img":"images/648403/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜先切成片，再切成丝。","img":"images/648403/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把双丝放在一起。","img":"images/648403/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐抓拌均匀。","img":"images/648403/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌制十分钟后用清水洗净多余的盐分。","img":"images/648403/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"韭菜叶洗净。","img":"images/648403/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出豆芽儿。","img":"images/648403/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用煮豆芽儿的水煮韭菜叶。","img":"images/648403/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把四种蔬菜放在盒子里，挤上辣酱，拌均匀即可。","img":"images/648403/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}